[ar:SIYUE]
[ti:Shadows fall across]
[by:netease]
[00:00.36]Shadows fall across the floor
[00:00.36]暗影漫过地板
[00:04.35]I’ m waiting on the line
[00:04.35]我在爱之边缘徘徊
[00:08.64]One word from you is all I need to know you’ ll still be mine
[00:08.64]只需你一语回应，我便知晓你仍属于我
[00:17.22]Thisain't just a fantasy, it’ s a gravity pull
[00:17.22]这绝非一场幻梦，而是宿命般的引力相吸
[00:21.60]Stealing all my sanity, breakin’ every rule
[00:21.60]耗尽我所有理智，冲破所有既定规矩
[00:25.71]Yeah, I know the risk, babe, I hear the thunder roll
[00:25.71]亲爱的，我明知这险境，亦听闻惊雷轰鸣
[00:29.40]But you’ re the one addiction that’ s taking back my soul
[00:29.40]可你是唯一的瘾，能将我迷失的灵魂救赎
[00:34.85]Every look, every sigh, yeah, it puts me in a trance
[00:34.85]你的每一次凝望，每一声轻叹，都让我深陷痴迷
[00:38.49]One touch from your electric fire, Idon't stand a chance
[00:38.49]你指尖炽热的温度，让我瞬间溃不成军
[00:42.39]I see the flash, the red light, but Ican't turn away
[00:42.39]我看见警示的红光闪烁，却终究无法转身离去
[00:46.26]Got a heartthat's locked up tight, and you hold the key to play
[00:46.26]我心门紧锁，唯你手握开启的密钥
[00:51.30]I'm a deadman walking, if you walk away tonight
[00:51.30]若你今夜转身离去，我便如行尸走肉
[00:55.38]Trapped inside the feeling, fading out the light
[00:55.38]困在这份情愫里，任光芒一寸寸黯淡
[00:59.34]Tell me that you want me, baby, say it to my face
[00:59.34]亲爱的，告诉我你渴望着我，亲口对我诉说
[01:03.09]'CauseI'm a deadman walking, dying in this empty space
[01:03.09]只因我已是行尸走肉，在这空洞里缓缓沉沦
[01:07.71]Don't you leave me here to burn,don't you leave me to the fire
[01:07.71]别留我独自灼烧，别弃我于烈焰之中
[01:17.24]I'm a deadman walking, fueled by this desire
[01:17.24]我如行尸走肉，被这份执念焚烧驱动
[01:25.47]The clock is ticking down to zero, can you feel the heat?
[01:25.47]时钟走向零点，你是否也能感受到这滚烫的焦灼
[01:29.58]Making a deal with the devil, something dark and sweet
[01:29.58]与魔鬼定下契约，一场黑暗又甜蜜的沉沦
[01:33.27]Just tell me where to meet you,I'll be waiting in the dark
[01:33.27]只需告诉我相遇的地点，我会在暗处静静等候
[01:37.53]Leaving my life behind me, leaving just a spark
